    "answer": {
      "short": "$12.5\\text{ cm}^2$",
      "worked": "A square is a rhombus, so use half the product of its two equal diagonals.\n$$\\begin{aligned}A&=\\frac12\\times5\\times5=12.5\\text{ cm}^2.\\end{aligned}$$",
